# Maven command-line arguments: Maven 3.3.1+ reads this file automatically,
# equivalent to passing these flags on every invocation.
#
# NOTE: this file is decoded with the PLATFORM charset, NOT UTF-8.
# Chinese comments here will abort Maven with a MalformedInputException on a
# GBK Windows host, so keep this file pure ASCII and leave -Dfile.encoding last.
#
# Why a project-local repository instead of the global ~/.m2 :
#   1. the global repository may be unwritable (sandbox / CI);
#   2. dependencies stay inside the project, so builds are reproducible and
#      can be wiped by deleting one directory.
# .mvn/repo is ignored by .gitignore and is never committed.
-Dmaven.repo.local=.mvn/repo
-Dfile.encoding=UTF-8
